    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584500/extras/5cad630bba459697661b4269ce865ca6.avif?t=1736232770\" width=589 height=101 /></span><br><strong>Surveillance</strong> is a spot the difference horror in which you have to prevent high paranormal activity In different places around the world. Identify suspicious changes in environment and <strong>take immediate action</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584500/extras/9c28b103a286d82c64819e0c868a2d7f.avif?t=1736232770\" width=589 height=71 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584500/extras/8831ca19d70e0488a4ed9e09fc53b03b.poster.avif?t=1736232770\" width=650 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584500/extras/8831ca19d70e0488a4ed9e09fc53b03b.webm?t=1736232770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584500/extras/8831ca19d70e0488a4ed9e09fc53b03b.mp4?t=1736232770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Many different places require your observation</strong>, includng <strong>Asylum</strong>, <strong>Polar Station</strong>, <strong>Backrooms</strong>, <strong>Spaceship</strong>, and even <strong>Castle</strong>!<br><br><br></li><li>Each location includes several rooms, and you need to keep an eye on each of them!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2584500/extras/0b29a5d37208dd5e7ef97ca42deb05a6.poster.avif?t=1736232770\" width=589 height=71 ><source src=\"htt